                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 24 at 2:29AM EST by NWS Wakefield VA",
                "description": "* TIMING: Until 4 PM this afternoon.\n\n* WINDS...North 10 to 15 mph with gusts up to 20-25 mph.\n\n* RELATIVE HUMIDITY...As low as 25 to 30 percent.\n\n* TEMPERATURES...In the lower 50s.\n\n* IMPACTS...Low relative humidities and breezy north winds could\nproduce favorable conditions for wildfires to spread today.\n\n\nResidents are urged to exercise caution handling any potential\nignition source, including machinery, cigarettes, and matches. Be\nsure to properly discard all smoking materials. Any dry grasses and\ntree litter that ignite will have the potential to spread\nquickly.",
